{
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "**The problem.** Given a string `s` of lowercase letters, `(` and `)`, remove the **fewest** parentheses so that the rest is valid — every `)` closes an earlier `(` and every `(` is closed. Return any valid result."
    },
    {
      "type": "drawing",
      "src": "/drawings/ada9e9bb-1924-4774-9d13-f12a2d2ba05b.svg",
      "alt": "The string a ) b ( c ) d (. The first ) has no open bracket before it, so it is removed, in red. The ( before c and the ) after it match, in green. The last ( is never closed, so it is removed too. The result is ab(c)d.",
      "width": 604,
      "height": 359,
